    "text": "<p>Match List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8208;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;(Event) with List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8208;</mo><mi>II</mi></math>&nbsp;(Order of the time interval for the happening of the event) and select the correct option from the options given below the lists.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<thead>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">&nbsp;</th>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">List-I</th>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">&nbsp;</th>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">List-II</th>\t\t</tr>\t</thead>\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>The rotation period of earth</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Revolution period of earth&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Period of a light wave&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td>Period of a sound wave&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>",
